# > - **A9.1 TreeSHAP Additivity Invariant:** Every local explanation satisfies $f(x) = \phi_0 + \sum_j \phi_j(x)$ within tolerance $\le 10^{-3}$.  
# > - **A9.2 Non-Causal Wording Invariant:** All explanations communicate statistical correlation, feature attribution, and operational coincidence. Causal-proof language ("caused by", "responsible for", "proves that") is strictly forbidden.  
# > - **A9.3 Test Partition Quarantine:** The test partition ($D_{\text{test}}$, Days 25–30) remains strictly locked. No explanations are generated or evaluated on test data.

